{"id":47402,"date":"2025-12-23T09:40:52","date_gmt":"2025-12-23T08:40:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-herois-sunset-trail\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:33:18","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:33:18","slug":"trilhos-herois-sunset-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-herois-sunset-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 2.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no final de tarde de <strong>26 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), na vila de <strong>Vila Franca das Naves<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Trancoso<\/strong>, distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. Organizado com enorme paix\u00e3o e cariz solid\u00e1rio pelos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Franca das Naves<\/strong> e cronometragem <strong>Wait a Start<\/strong>, o evento integra oficialmente os <strong>Circuitos Nacionais de Trail e Trail Sprint da ATRP<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e meta instaladas no <strong>Quartel dos Bombeiros<\/strong>, os atletas enfrentam os exigentes trilhos da Beira Alta sob as cores m\u00e1gicas do p\u00f4r do sol, distribu\u00eddos pelo <strong>Trail Longo 31 km (1000m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto 19 km (650m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>16:30<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada 12 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>16:45<\/strong> e pelo carinhoso <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong> no recinto do quartel.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 16:00<\/span><\/li>\n<l