dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Franca das Naves, Trancoso, Guarda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa conta com o Trail Longo de 31 km (1000m D+), o Trail Curto de 19 km (650m D+), a Caminhada dos Her\u00f3is de 12 km (400m D+) e o Trail Kids.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As provas pontuam para os circuitos oficiais de Trail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, as dist\u00e2ncias de 31 km e 19 km integram oficialmente a Ta\u00e7a e os Circuitos Nacionais de Trail da ATRP.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e a causa apoiada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 promovido pelo Corpo de Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Franca das Naves, revertendo o apoio para a sua miss\u00e3o de prote\u00e7\u00e3o civil e socorro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Wait a Start at\u00e9 ao prazo regulamentar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Franca das Naves\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Trancoso\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Franca das Naves \/ ATRP\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro de 2